WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.610 --> 00:00:07.490
. Last Wednesday was a very important day
because we had an article published in The

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:13.660
Atlantic about Donald Trump's plan to steal
this election should he lose to Joe Biden.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:14.660
We talked about it.

00:00:14.660 --> 00:00:20.410
The plan is to use allegations of fraud to
justify Trump choosing Republican electors,

00:00:20.410 --> 00:00:24.990
even in states where Joe Biden won by saying,
well, Joe Biden didn't really win because

00:00:24.990 --> 00:00:25.990
of fraud.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:31.210
So I'm going to send Republican electors or
ask the state legislature to send Republican

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:32.460
electors.

00:00:32.460 --> 00:00:36.190
This would be done in conjunction with the
use of lawyers to stop the counting of absentee

00:00:36.190 --> 00:00:38.150
ballots on Election Day.

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:39.410
This is a major story.

00:00:39.410 --> 00:00:44.730
This is a story of a desperate sitting president
with a very specific plan to subvert the will

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.070
of the people to destroy democracy.

00:00:47.070 --> 00:00:52.010
You would think that that would be 24/7 coverage
because it is a red alert disaster.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:57.960
And yet The New York Times put a story about
it on page 15 of the newspaper that day.

00:00:57.960 --> 00:01:03.649
The Washington Post put it closer to the front,
but many pages back from the front page.

00:01:03.649 --> 00:01:05.950
Cable channels gave it some coverage.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:13.280
Fox News barely, but not really anything commensurate
or properly proportional given the scope and

00:01:13.280 --> 00:01:14.620
magnitude of the story.

00:01:14.620 --> 00:01:19.460
A president not just with the vague idea of
trying to stay in power if he loses, but a

00:01:19.460 --> 00:01:25.380
specific plan that he and strategists and
Republican attorneys are discussing.

00:01:25.380 --> 00:01:27.100
And it didn't get that much coverage.

00:01:27.100 --> 00:01:32.310
And then on top of this, after the article
came out, Brian Carrum asked Donald Trump

00:01:32.310 --> 00:01:37.369
at a press briefing, will you commit to a
peaceful transition of power if you lose?

00:01:37.369 --> 00:01:39.670
And Donald Trump said, well, it depends on
the results.

00:01:39.670 --> 00:01:43.500
Remember this clip from last week when he
has a role in this election?

00:01:43.500 --> 00:01:50.729
Will you commit here today for a peaceful
transfer of power after the election?

00:01:50.729 --> 00:01:53.140
There has been rioting a lot.

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:57.330
There's been rioting in many cities across
this country, bread and your so-called red

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:58.729
and blue states.

00:01:58.729 --> 00:02:03.170
Will you commit to making sure that there
is a peaceful transfer of power after the

00:02:03.170 --> 00:02:04.170
election?

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.450
Going to have to see what happens.

00:02:05.450 --> 00:02:10.899
You know that I've been complaining very strongly
about the ballots and the ballots are disaster

00:02:10.899 --> 00:02:12.770
and that people are rioting.

00:02:12.770 --> 00:02:17.940
Do you commit to making sure that there's
a place where we want to get rid of the ballots

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:19.209
and you'll have a very transfer?

00:02:19.209 --> 00:02:20.760
We'll have a very peaceful.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:22.330
There won't be a transfer, frankly.

00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:24.220
There'll be a continuation.

00:02:24.220 --> 00:02:27.280
The ballots are at a control, you know.

00:02:27.280 --> 00:02:29.250
And you know, who knows it better than anybody
else?

00:02:29.250 --> 00:02:32.810
The Democrats know it better than anybody
else.

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:38.920
You know, for all of the talk about how the
media are so liberal and so anti Trump and

00:02:38.920 --> 00:02:42.810
blah, blah, blah, the coverage of this story
was lacking.

00:02:42.810 --> 00:02:47.819
The only reasonable answer to will you commit
to a peaceful transition of power if you lose

00:02:47.819 --> 00:02:48.819
is.

00:02:48.819 --> 00:02:49.819
Of course I will.

00:02:49.819 --> 00:02:50.819
Yes.

00:02:50.819 --> 00:02:52.260
So there is a real question here.

00:02:52.260 --> 00:02:59.379
Why did so many editors who decide what gets
on TV as I lose my Sharpie up, what gets published?

00:02:59.379 --> 00:03:01.019
Where in newspapers?

00:03:01.019 --> 00:03:03.069
Why did they bury the story?

00:03:03.069 --> 00:03:07.060
Dan Froomkin from Salon has one idea.

00:03:07.060 --> 00:03:12.450
And the idea is that news editors couldn't
possibly report this story without having

00:03:12.450 --> 00:03:14.570
to sound a major alarm.

00:03:14.570 --> 00:03:18.030
And that very often editors don't want.

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:22.650
Sound major alarms because they are afraid
of appearing partizan and taking heat and

00:03:22.650 --> 00:03:27.680
that this story is so outrageous that you
can't really touch it without making it clear

00:03:27.680 --> 00:03:32.440
that this is about does our democracy hold
so that that's why they didn't run the story

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:35.180
or didn't run it prominently or didn't talk
about it much?

00:03:35.180 --> 00:03:39.780
I actually think there's a much more dangerous
and disturbing explanation for why this story

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.780
did not get the coverage it deserved.

00:03:41.780 --> 00:03:44.720
And it's that Trump's base doesn't care about
it.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:50.560
They don't have a problem with Donald Trump
saying this when 30 to 40 percent of the country

00:03:50.560 --> 00:03:54.200
would accept a stolen election as long as
it's their guy who stole it.

00:03:54.200 --> 00:03:58.110
Is it really a big story if half the country
wouldn't be outraged?

00:03:58.110 --> 00:03:59.690
That is the real tragedy.

00:03:59.690 --> 00:04:06.130
They keep being told Democrats are stealing
and committing fraud and all this stuff.

00:04:06.130 --> 00:04:09.920
For four years, they've been doing it and
the news is fake.

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:16.419
How do you even get them to care about a president
saying, yeah, I might steal the election or

00:04:16.419 --> 00:04:17.979
try to anyway?

00:04:17.979 --> 00:04:24.059
This is the end point conclusion of the I
can shoot people on Fifth Avenue and not lose

00:04:24.059 --> 00:04:25.060
support mentality.

00:04:25.060 --> 00:04:27.589
The bet has been made.

00:04:27.589 --> 00:04:31.040
And now how do we get people to stop sleeping
in it?

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:35.159
It is very dark times potentially that are
coming here.

00:04:35.159 --> 00:04:40.729
We're going to have more coverage of this
on our Instagram page, David Pakman show on

00:04:40.729 --> 00:04:42.039
Instagram.

00:04:42.039 --> 00:04:46.129
And if you want something light, because things
are pretty dark, if you want a video of me

00:04:46.129 --> 00:04:50.360
chasing puppies around, actually, I guess
the puppies are chasing me around.

00:04:50.360 --> 00:04:51.360
It's not clear.

00:04:51.360 --> 00:04:52.360
There's a lot of running.

00:04:52.360 --> 00:04:54.650
Follow me on Instagram at David Pakman.

00:04:54.650 --> 00:04:55.229
We'll be back after this.

